OL,3,GNEWSAPlans lodged to repair fire-hit
OL,4,Abowls pavilion
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans have been submitted to repair a
OL,7,Fbowls pavilion that was partly
OL,8,Fdestroyed in a fire earlier this year.
OL,10,FThe building at Usworth Park in
OL,11,FWashington, which was damaged in a
OL,12,Fsuspected arson attack, would undergo
OL,13,Fextensive repair work under proposals
OL,14,Flodged with Sunderland City Council.
OL,16,FThe scheme includes replacement
OL,17,Fwindows, new external rendering and
OL,18,Fchanges to the pavilion's entrance to
OL,19,Fmeet current building regulations.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
