OL,3,GNEWSAPlans lodged to repair fire-hit
OL,4,Abowls pavilion
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter the blaze, bowling club
OL,7,Fpresident, Barrie Bulch, said "people
OL,8,Fwere in tears to see the club go up in
OL,9,Fsmoke".
